        "items": [
          {
            "source": "exception",
            "description": "Error: Hydration failed because the server rendered text didn't match the client. As a result this tree will be regenerated on the client. This can happen if a SSR-ed Client Component used:\n\n- A server/client branch `if (typeof window !== 'undefined')`.\n- Variable input such as `Date.now()` or `Math.random()` which changes each time it's called.\n- Date formatting in a user's locale which doesn't match the server.\n- External changing data without sending a snapshot of it along with the HTML.\n- Invalid HTML tag nesting.\n\nIt can also happen if the client has a browser extension installed which messes with the HTML before React loaded.\n\nhttps://react.dev/link/hydration-mismatch\n\n  ...\n    <HTTPAccessFallbackBoundary notFound={<NotAllowedRootHTTPFallbackError>}>\n      <HTTPAccessFallbackErrorBoundary pathname=\"/incidents...\" notFound={<NotAllowedRootHTTPFallbackError>} ...>\n        <RedirectBoundary>\n          <RedirectErrorBoundary router={{...}}>\n            <Head>\n            <__next_root_layout_boundary__>\n              <SegmentViewNode type=\"layout\" pagePath=\"layout.tsx\">\n                <SegmentTrieNode>\n                <link>\n                <script>\n                <RootLayout>\n                  <html lang=\"es\">\n                    <body>\n                      <nav className=\"navbar\">\n                        <div className=\"navContent\">\n                          <LinkComponent>\n                          <AuthNav>\n                            <div className=\"navLinks\">\n                              <LinkComponent href=\"/\">\n                                <a\n                                  ref={function}\n                                  onClick={function onClick}\n                                  onMouseEnter={function onMouseEnter}\n                                  onTouchStart={function onTouchStart}\n+                                 href=\"/\"\n-                                 href=\"/login\"\n                                >\n+                                 Inicio\n-                                 Entrar\n                              ...\n                      ...\n            ...\n\n    at throwOnHydrationMismatch (https://potential-xylophone-69rw9rppj5g35jww-3001.app.github.dev/_next/static/chunks/0jo__next_dist_compiled_react-dom_0gwh9_b._.js:3120:56)\n    at prepareToHydrateHostInstance (https://potential-xylophone-69rw9rppj5g35jww-3001.app.github.dev/_next/static/chunks/0jo__next_dist_compiled_react-dom_0gwh9_b._.js:3174:23)\n    at completeWork (https://potential-xylophone-69rw9rppj5g35jww-3001.app.github.dev/_next/static/chunks/0jo__next_dist_compiled_react-dom_0gwh9_b._.js:6749:60)\n    at runWithFiberInDEV (https://potential-xylophone-69rw9rppj5g35jww-3001.app.github.dev/_next/static/chunks/0jo__next_dist_compiled_react-dom_0gwh9_b._.js:761:74)\n    at completeUnitOfWork (https://potential-xylophone-69rw9rppj5g35jww-3001.app.github.dev/_next/static/chunks/0jo__next_dist_compiled_react-dom_0gwh9_b._.js:9452:23)\n    at performUnitOfWork (https://potential-xylophone-69rw9rppj5g35jww-3001.app.github.dev/_next/static/chunks/0jo__next_dist_compiled_react-dom_0gwh9_b._.js:9387:28)\n    at workLoopConcurrentByScheduler (https://potential-xylophone-69rw9rppj5g35jww-3001.app.github.dev/_next/static/chunks/0jo__next_dist_compiled_react-dom_0gwh9_b._.js:9381:58)\n    at renderRootConcurrent (https://potential-xylophone-69rw9rppj5g35jww-3001.app.github.dev/_next/static/chunks/0jo__next_dist_compiled_react-dom_0gwh9_b._.js:9364:71)\n    at performWorkOnRoot (https://potential-xylophone-69rw9rppj5g35jww-3001.app.github.dev/_next/static/chunks/0jo__next_dist_compiled_react-dom_0gwh9_b._.js:8891:150)\n    at performWorkOnRootViaSchedulerTask (https://potential-xylophone-69rw9rppj5g35jww-3001.app.github.dev/_next/static/chunks/0jo__next_dist_compiled_react-dom_0gwh9_b._.js:10085:9)\n    at MessagePort.performWorkUntilDeadline (https://potenti